# `pod_window.sh` writes one directory per window here. A LIVE window's is the
# product — D4 has the batch copy the phase-1 sketches into it so a later
# head-noun merge fix can re-census them without renting a second pod — so
# nothing here is ignored wholesale.
#
# A `--rehearse` directory is the opposite: it proves the preflight ran, the
# commit body carries its table, and a tree of stale rehearsals under differing
# verdict schemes would misread as evidence about the live batch.
rehearse-*/
